dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.model.mutation
version 1
schema stdio.semio.model.mutation
start body
framing record

# P2 pilot (model): REAL binary op frame, replacing the old plain `serde_json::to_vec`/`from_slice`
# shortcut (`🧬️mutations/🦀️.rs`'s old `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op`).
# `SemioModelMutation` is a genuine data-carrying enum whose variants embed nested `SpatialNode`/
# `SemioModelElement`/`ModelRelation`/`SemioModelSnapshot` payloads — no `dsl::DslField` impl exists
# for any of them (hand-rolled per this subset's own `🔺️diff`/`🧬️mutations` convention), so the
# generic derive-based `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout doesn't apply. Handcrafted
# instead: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT` convention) + `tag u8` (the `SemioModelMutation` variant
# ordinal, `🧬️mutations/🦀️.rs`'s `OP_KEYWORDS`/`variant_ordinal`, same 0-10 ordering as
# `parse_semio_model_mutation`'s keyword match) as two REAL fixed fields, then the variant's own
# `key=value ...` argument payload as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain — the same honest boundary
# the sibling `../../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️.protocol.semio` uses.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8

chain payload bytes
